// /*******************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************
//  * @description : Rotate the currently displayed colours (pure framebuffer rotate).
//  *                - No repaint; rotates whatever is already shown on the LEDs.
//  *
//  * Controls:
//  *   SX (Speed)      → Base frame time. Rubber-banding scales the frame time only.
